=== Enum8: legacy string-wrapped form with double-quoted elements (JSONEachRow) ===
1	['a','b']
2	['a','c']
=== Enum8: legacy double-quoted elements, native single-quoted (VALUES) ===
3	['a','c']
5	['a','b']
=== Date: legacy double-quoted elements and native single-quoted ===
1	['2020-01-01','2020-01-02']
2	['2021-05-05','2021-06-06']
3	['2022-02-02']
=== UInt64: legacy quoted numbers and native bare numbers ===
1	[1,2]
2	[3,4]
3	[5,6]
=== Nullable(UInt64): native NULL keyword still works ===
1	[1,2]
2	[3,4]
=== UUID: legacy double-quoted elements ===
1	['00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002']
2	['00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003']
=== Array argument type keeps the native form (composite types are not on the legacy path) ===
1	[['x','y'],['z']]
